  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Điều kiện xác định của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy tập xác định của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Điều kiện xác định của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy tập xác định của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1<